    > LvlTabY_u8/16/32/64 (shortcut into ltY_u8/16/32/64)
      in which Y is DLT__CHKSZ, pcpl itm going

    > Default available types includes:
      chunk-size: 32, 64 (+ custom)
      levels: 0-levelMax
      levelMax: 4 for everyone for the moment, but make this constant specific for the targetted type (u8/16/32/64)

lvl3Tab64_u8 a = ^Lvl3Tab64_u8.new()

l3t64_u8 a = ^L3T64_u8.new()

